## STATE FILE

**Location:** `project/output_biztalk/{app_name}/.biztalk-state.json`

```json
{
  "appName": "",
  "inputPath": "",
  "currentPhase": 0,
  "inventory": {
    "orchestrations": [], "maps": [], "schemas": [],
    "pipelines": [], "helpers": [], "absentReferences": []
  },
  "counts": { "orchestrations": 0, "maps": 0, "schemas": 0, "pipelines": 0, "helpers": 0 },
  "sectionStatus": {
    "section1": "PENDING", "section2": "PENDING", "section3": "PENDING",
    "section4": "PENDING", "section5": "PENDING", "section6": "PENDING", "section7": "PENDING"
  },
  "replicationGaps": [],
  "phaseStatuses": {
    "phase0": "PENDING", "phase1": "PENDING", "phase2": "PENDING",
    "phase3": "PENDING", "phase4": "PENDING", "phase5": "PENDING"
  }
}
```

### State File Update Protocol
After each phase/section completes: update `currentPhase`, set the section/phase status to `COMPLETED`, append discovered items to `inventory`/`replicationGaps`, add `completedAt` timestamp.

### Resume Capability
On activation: if `.biztalk-state.json` exists → show last completed phase, offer **resume** (continue from next PENDING) or **restart**. If absent → start fresh at Phase 0.

---

## PHASE EXECUTION RULES

**Before each phase:** verify prior phase complete; load `@00_Template_Configuration.mdc`; produce `<thinking>` block.
**During each phase:** follow phase tasks; apply RGV per section; write to file progressively (never dump full content in chat); assess confidence.
**After each phase:** emit count-verified micro-checkpoint; update state file.

---

## ERROR RECOVERY

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| UTF-16/garbled read | Re-read as text, strip BOM, decode before parsing |
| Map logic unclear from `.btm` | Read the paired `.xsl`; if still unclear → ⚠️ ASSUMPTION + note both files |
| Referenced assembly/schema absent | Document call-site + 🔴 GAP; never invent |
| Count mismatch (RGV) | RE-READ source, locate missing element, fix before checkpoint |
| Interrupted run | State preserved; resume from last PENDING phase |

